<%# ===== SECURITY & TRUST ===== %>
<section class="relative bg-gray-950 py-20 sm:py-28 overflow-hidden" data-controller="scroll-animate">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-dark"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-mesh-gradient-dark"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <%= render "shared/section_heading",
        eyebrow: "Security & Trust",
        title: "Your contracts are sensitive. We treat them that way.".html_safe,
        subtitle: "PactBadger is built with security at every layer — from how your data is transmitted to who can access it.",
        dark: true %>

    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 glass-card-dark animate-on-scroll hover-lift">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 10-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-white">Encrypted in transit & at rest</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">All connections are encrypted via TLS/HTTPS with strict transport security enforced. Your data is also encrypted at rest — documents in storage and records in the database are protected even when not in use.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 glass-card-dark animate-on-scroll stagger-1 hover-lift">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-white">Tenant isolation & role-based access</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Each organization's data is isolated at the application layer. Owner, admin, and member roles control who can view, edit, or manage contracts and settings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 glass-card-dark animate-on-scroll stagger-2 hover-lift">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h3.75M9 15h3.75M9 18h3.75m3 .75H18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.108c0-1.135-.845-2.098-1.976-2.192a48.424 48.424 0 00-1.123-.08m-5.801 0c-.065.21-.1.433-.1.664 0 .414.336.75.75.75h4.5a.75.75 0 00.75-.75 2.25 2.25 0 00-.1-.664m-5.8 0A2.251 2.251 0 0113.5 2.25H15c1.012 0 1.867.668 2.15 1.586m-5.8 0c-.376.023-.75.05-1.124.08C9.095 4.01 8.25 4.973 8.25 6.108V8.25m0 0H4.875c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h9.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.375c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H8.25zM6.75 12h.008v.008H6.75V12zm0 3h.008v.008H6.75V15zm0 3h.008v.008H6.75V18z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-white">Comprehensive audit logging</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Every meaningful action — document uploads, review decisions, role changes, password updates — is logged with timestamps so your team has a clear audit trail.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 glass-card-dark animate-on-scroll stagger-1 hover-lift">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 5.25a3 3 0 013 3m3 0a6 6 0 01-7.029 5.912c-.563-.097-1.159.026-1.563.43L10.5 17.25H8.25v2.25H6v2.25H2.25v-2.818c0-.597.237-1.17.659-1.591l6.499-6.499c.404-.404.527-1 .43-1.563A6 6 0 1121.75 8.25z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-white">Secure authentication</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Passwords are one-way hashed using industry-standard algorithms and never stored in plain text. Sessions use signed, HttpOnly cookies with rate limiting on login and registration to prevent brute-force attacks.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 glass-card-dark animate-on-scroll stagger-2 hover-lift">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 004.5 4.5H18a3.75 3.75 0 001.332-7.257 3 3 0 00-3.758-3.848 5.25 5.25 0 00-10.233 2.33A4.502 4.502 0 002.25 15z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-white">AWS-hosted document storage</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">Uploaded contract documents are stored in Amazon S3 with signed, time-limited URLs. Only authenticated users within your organization can access your files.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 glass-card-dark animate-on-scroll stagger-3 hover-lift">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-500/10">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-white">Responsible AI processing</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">AI extraction is powered by Anthropic's Claude via their secure API. Document text is transmitted over HTTPS and is not used to train AI models, per Anthropic's API data policy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
