      Stop losing money on <span class="text-gradient-light">missed deadlines</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-400 animate-on-scroll stagger-1">
      Join teams that track their contracts with confidence.
      Get started in under two minutes — no credit card, no commitment.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 animate-on-scroll stagger-2">
      <%= link_to "Start Free Today", new_registration_path,
          class: "rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 shadow-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-all duration-200" %>
      <%= link_to "See Pricing", pricing_path,
          class: "rounded-full border border-gray-700 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:border-gray-500 hover:text-white transition-all duration-200" %>
